<title>HONG KONG: S&amp;P rates Queensland Treasury Corp samurai 'AAr'.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P rates Queensland Treasury Corp samurai 'AAr'.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said on Thursday it had assigned its &quot;AAr&quot; rating on Queensland Treasury Corp's 20 billion yen dual currency samurai bonds, maturing December 9, 1999.</p>
</text>
